{"id":"c502117a84587a7c","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-category-equivalence.md","title":"Definition — 范畴等价","display":"Definition — 范畴等价","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-category-equivalence","aliases":["14-df-category-equivalence"],"display":"Definition — 范畴等价","depends_on":["[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-category-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-category-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 范畴等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"637a464575207be3\" href=\"?note=637a464575207be3\" title=\"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor\">14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为函子；自然变换为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a> 的带源、靶、分量三元组。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha_A\">\\(\\alpha_A\\)</span> 始终简写其分量。</li>\n<li>自然变换的复合和恒等均把给出的分量族提升为对应带源靶三元组。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall h:FA\\to FB\\ \\exists!k:A\\to B\\ Fk=h\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists u:FC\\to D\\ \\operatorname{IsIso}(u)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall h:FA\\to FB\\ \\exists!k:A\\to B\\ Fk=h\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists u:FC\\to D\\ \\operatorname{IsIso}(u)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists F\\ (\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists F\\ (\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书各处的 equivalence 均是范畴等价，区别于对象集合双射。全忠实且本质满射在所固定宇宙及元理论选择下等价于具有准逆。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor","status":"resolved","id":"637a464575207be3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-isomorphism-fully-faithful-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 为函子；自然变换为 [[14-df-natural-transformation]] 的带源、靶、分量三元组。$\\alpha_A$ 始终简写其分量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\forall h:FA\\to FB\\ \\exists!k:A\\to B\\ Fk=h\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall D\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\ \\exists C\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists u:FC\\to D\\ \\operatorname{IsIso}(u)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\simeq\\mathcal D\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists F\\ (\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\land\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(F)).","display":true}],"bytes":1321,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence|Definition — 范畴等价]]"},{"id":"a76b2bc2c7b718cf","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是固定的 $\\mathcal U$-小多类签名，$S_0$ 为其类集合；$\\mathbb T$ 是 [[14-df-geometric-theory-models]] 的有穷几何理论。$\\mathcal B$ 为候选范畴；$\\mathrm{IsGrothendieckTopos}$ 见 [[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]。模型范畴见 [[14-df-model-homomorphisms-and-category]]，几何态射范畴见 [[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]，函子等价见 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"37f646888720f3eb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IsFiniteTypeSite}$ 与 $\\mathrm{IsCoherentTopos}$ 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词；范畴等价采用 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-127","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"},{"id":"4831e90790611a73","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"552e996c15863488","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ 是指定单位 $\\eta$、余单位 $\\varepsilon$ 的伴随数据，满足 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]] 的两条三角式。取 [[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]] 的 $T=GF$、$\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)})$。代数范畴及自由/遗忘函子见 [[14-df-monad-algebras]]。$D,D'$ 是 $\\mathcal D$ 对象；比较函子记 $\\mathsf K$，避免与代数对象的通用字母混同。单子性谓词保留所指定伴随的全部参数；范畴等价采用 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"1133a7264b20c603","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"98293f53034b1166","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence|Definition — 范畴等价]]"},{"id":"f1b3afad9b25fc1d","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"最后给出[[14-df-category-equivalence]]所需的具体等价理由。任意代数 $K$ 通过可逆单位 $\\lambda_K:K\\to\\mathsf K(LK)$ 与比较函子的像同构，故本质满射。对 $u:\\mathsf K D\\to\\mathsf K D'$，令\n$h=\\kappa_{D'}\\,L(u)\\,\\kappa_D^{-1}$。\n单位自然性和三角式给 $\\mathsf K(h)=u$：$\\mathsf K\\kappa_D=\\lambda_{\\mathsf K D}^{-1}$，代入即得。若 $\\mathsf K(h)=\\mathsf K(h')$，施 $L$ 并用 $\\kappa$ 自然性及其可逆性，得 $h=h'$。所以比较函子全忠实且本质满射，即为等价。两个附加假设在证明中的用途清楚分开，所有比较箭头来自[[14-thm-beck-comparison-left-adjoint]]的实际构造。"},{"id":"5d8dd49e5f3240a8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"34f27739c5ea48f5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fd293da57bc98716","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"eeaa128b028a8273","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9d9b4e06b950da5b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1f1269584b34ad4b","1bdaf4a293143165","637a464575207be3","d5f547b903550705"]}